Not derived from Airweave
-------------------------

The Slack connector (sources/slack.py, entities/slack.py) is our own. Airweave's
Slack source is a federated-search adapter over search.messages that does not
sync; ours crawls conversations.list, .history, .replies and .members. The two
share no implementation.

The Clio connector (sources/clio.py, entities/clio.py, cursors/clio.py) is our
own. Airweave has no Clio connector.

This notice states what is derived and names the two connectors that provably
are not. It makes no blanket claim about the remainder of the package: a file
with no same-named Airweave counterpart was not matched by the audit behind this
notice, and "no counterpart by filename" is not the same as "verified original".

